                     character will be removed.\page !FRSTCHK!\tab\tab    This is the section of the program labeled \i !FRSTCHK!\i0 .  When the\par
                     program continues here, the portion of the edit buffer being\par
                     processed is not at the end of the file.  As such, initial <FF>\par
                     checking (when a <FF> is not the first character in the file)\par
                     can be checked at this point.\par
\par
