\b Line 17\tab\tab    !NOCH!EFEX$!NOTEOF!QSJOPUTIN$\b0\par
\par
!NOCH!EFEX$\tab\tab    All retained characters in the edit buffer (if any) have been\par
                     processed.  Close the file with an \ul E\ulnone nd \ul F\ulnone ile command.  TECO\par
                     \ul EX\ulnone its to the operating system.  All relevant characters\par
                     (within the pragmatic sequence specially checked for) were\par
                     removed as required.\page !NOTEOF!QSJOPUTIN$   If the pragmatic sequence of characters expected after the\par
