\par
'0A&127-10"N10I$'\tab    If the latest character is a <CR> character, test the next\par
\tab\tab\tab    character (0A) masking the high-order bit (&127); if the next\par
                     character is not a <LF> character, insert a <LF> character\par
                     after the <CR> character.  Certain PDP-8 files (occasionally)\par
