␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀PTY"?
	JMP	CFBFWT	/NO; GO WAIT MORE.
CFCDWT,	RCSE		/TRY TO READ A CARD.
	SKP		/NO GOOD.
	JMP	CFCLWT	/GOT ONE; GO READ IT.
	JMS	CFDISP	/DISPLAY ERROR BIT.
	 2000		/2000=READER NOT READY.
	JMS	CDRNXT	/CO-ROUTINE EXIT.
	JMP	CFCDWT	/TRY AGAIN.
CFCLWT,	JMS	CDRNXT	/CO-ROUTINE EXIT.
	JMS	CFKCHK	/CHECK KEYBOARD.
	RCSD		/GOT CARD DONE FLAG?
	SKP		/NO; KEEP CHECKING.
	JMP	CFDONE	/YES; GO CHK LENGTH.
	RCSF		/GOT COLUMN FLAG?
	JMP I	CDRCHK	/NO; EXIT.
	CLA		/YES; MAKE SURE AC CLR.
	RCRB		/READ IN COLUMN.
	DCA I	CFCPTR	/STORE IN BUFFER.
	INC	CFCPTR	/BUMP BUFFER PTR.
	JMP I	CDRCHK	/EXIT.
/(CO-ROUTINE CONTINUED.)  END OF CARD HANDLING.
CFDONE,	CLA		/MAKE SURE AC CLEAR.
	RCRD		/CLEAR DONE FLAG.
	LAC	CFCCTR	/GET COLUMN CTR.
	TAD	CFM120	/=80 COLUMNS?
	SZA CLA
	JMP	CFLBAD	/NO; GO DISPLAY ERROR.
	JMS	CDRNXT	/YES; CO-ROUTINE EXIT.
	JMP	CDRTOP	/GO DO NEXT CARD.
 
/BAD CARD LENGTH HANDLING.
CFLBAD,	JMS	CFDISP	/DISPLAY ERROR BIT.
	 200		/200=BAD CARD LENGTH.
	JMS	CDRNXT	/CO-ROUTINE EXIT.
	JMP	CFLBAD	/JUST HANG.
CNXTBP,	 CNXTBF
CFCPTR,	 0!0
CFCCTR,	 0!0
CFM120,	 -120
 
/S/R TO DISPLAY CARD READER ERROR STATUS IN AC.
CFDISP,	 0!0
	JMS	CFKCHK	/GO CHECK KEYBOARD.
	CLA		/MAKE SURE AC CLEAR.
	LAC	CFDM26	/SET DELAY CTR.
	DCA	CFDCTR
	LAC I	CFDISP	/GET ERROR BIT.
	INC	CFDISP	/BUMP TO RTRN.
CFDELA,	ISZ	CFDCTR	/DELAY 99 USEC.
	JMP	CFDELA
	CLA		/KILL ERROR BIT.
	JMP I	CFDISP	/EXIT.
CFDM26,	 -26
CFDCTR,	 0!0
/S/R TO CHECK FOR KEYBOARD INTERRUPTS.
CFKCHK,	 0!0
	KSF		/ANYTHING ON KEYBOARD?
	JMP I	CFKCHK	/NO; EXIT.
	CLA		/YES; CLEAR AC.
	KRS		/READ IT IN STATIC.
	AND	K177	/TOSS PARITY BIT.
	TAD	CFKM22	/IS IT CTRL/R?
	SZA
	JMP	CFKZCK	/NO; GO CHECK CTRL/Z.
	STA		/YES; BACK UP BUFFER
	TAD	CFPTR	 /HEADER POINTER.
	DCA	CFPTR
	JMP	CDRST	/GO RE-READ LAST CARD.
CFKZCK,	TAD	CFMCZ	/IS IT CTRL/Z?
	SZA CLA
	JMP I	CFKCHK	/NO; EXIT.
	INC I	CFPTR	/YES; MARK BUFF "FULL".
	STA		/BACK UP BUFFER
	TAD	CFPTR	 /HEADER POINTER.
	DCA	CFPTR
	LAC I	CFPTR	/GET PTR TO BUFFER.
	DCA	CFCPTR	/RESET COLUMN PTR.
	LAC	CFKEOF	/GET EOF CODE.
	DCA I	CFCPTR	/PUT IN COL 1 OF BUFF.
	JMP I	CFKCHK	/EXIT.
CFKM22,	 -22
CFMCZ,	 22-32
CFKEOF,	 7007		/EOF CODE.
/HOLLERITH TO ASCII CONVERSION TABLE.
CITBL,	 0		/SPACE	NO PUNCHES.
	 0-4006		/!	12-7-8.
	 4006-6		/"	7-8.
	 6-102		/NUMBER	3-8.
	 102-2102	/$	11-3-8.
